{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-14","kind":"proposition","title":"两平行方形等一角又等即等角旁之两边为互相视之边两平行方形的一角等而等角旁两…","englishTitle":"In equal and equiangular parallelograms the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; and equiangular parallelograms in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional are equal.","book":6,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","contentId":"euclid-6-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa19b93e28bd50882a66a87ec89f8a1fec05a04c98411735cb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-14.statement","euclid-6-14.construction.1","euclid-6-14.proof.1","euclid-6-14.construction.2","euclid-6-14.proof.2","euclid-6-14.proof.3","euclid-6-14.proof.4","euclid-6-14.proof.5","euclid-6-14.proof.6","euclid-6-14.conclusion","euclid-6-14.historical.1","euclid-6-14.historical.2","euclid-6-14.historical.3","euclid-6-14.historical.4","euclid-6-14.historical.5","euclid-6-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e45b1ddd155220267c32e012f26650e62ea820a4fe16d75acfd29f825027d588","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal and equiangular parallelograms the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; and equiangular parallelograms in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平等而等角平行四边形中,对等角度成比例的两边;对等角度平行四边形的两边成比例的对等角度成比例是等角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行方形等一角又等即等角旁之两边为互相视之边两平行方形之一角等而等角旁两边为互相视之边即两形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个平行四边形的角相等；其中一个角也相等；也就是说，等角相邻的两边是互相对看的边；两个平行四边形的一个角相等，且等角相邻的两边是互相对看的边；也就是说，这两个图形相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37d3b9162610d6e6b23616c2ac0380af73ce5fab462a20a2272a97e8eb37c14f","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, BC be equal and equiangular parallelograms having the angles at B equal, and let DB, BE be placed in a straight line; therefore FB, BG are also in a straight line. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,BC等量的角为B的角为平行四边形等量的角,让DB,BE等量的线被置于直线中,因此FB,BG等量的线也处于直线中。 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5db18f165da0dbf162cded11adaf6995bbb06f6fcf082ed6f7ade05b0faf6c41","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that, in AB, BC, the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, that is to say, that, as DB is to BE, so is GB to BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,在AB,BC中,关于平等角度的两面是对等的成比例,也就是说,DB对BE的比等于GB对BF的比；DB 与 BE 之比等于 GB 与 BF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a03a0d53f842985c9517016736840711b9617d0f8248ee21872968e69a0b219","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the parallelogram FE be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成平行四边形 FE"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"368685a54f91fb280c0e3d3940ee2351b1d53d5b92f793413df1fa17f07cda1c","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the parallelogram AB is equal to the parallelogram BC, and FE is another area, therefore, as AB is to FE, so is BC to FE. [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平行四边形 AB等于平行四边形 BC,FE是另一个区域,因此,AB对FE的比等于BC对FE的比；AB 与 FE 之比等于 BC 与 FE 之比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec35f5ed218c672bb3781c32f5fdff8e4e75b54871f311ef7bc5fb0c4ba3a667","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to FE, so is DB to BE, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and, as BC is to FE, so is GB to BF. [id.] therefore also, as DB is to BE, so is GB to BF. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB对FE的比等于DB对BE的比,BC对FE的比等于GB对BF的比,因此,DB对BE的比等于GB对BF的比；AB 与 FE 之比等于 DB 与 BE 之比；BC 与 FE 之比等于 GB 与 BF 之比；DB 与 BE 之比等于 GB 与 BF 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"067d7d84ab9088635ea07f3c3a270437f9f70e94fe01f624b9d684a56da057ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelograms AB, BC the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行四边形 AB BC 中,关于平等角度的两边是对等的成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5053f4b1fb20d9561913ef26b6758ea61c2305cf478f8f400dc11cbec8ad0b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let GB be to BF as DB to BE; I say that the parallelogram AB is equal to the parallelogram BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,GB比BF等于DB比BE;我说平行四边形比AB等于平行四边形比BC；GB 与 BF 之比等于 DB 与 BE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dab068ba443afb2dd06fce8950c96776499b28375951104f334f79c3052ed9d","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11","euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as DB is to BE, so is GB to BF, while, as DB is to BE, so is the parallelogram AB to the parallelogram FE, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and, as GB is to BF, so is the parallelogram BC to the parallelogram FE, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as AB is to FE, so is BC to FE; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore the parallelogram AB is equal to the parallelogram BC. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB-BE的比相当于GB-BF,DB-BE的比等于平行四边形-AB与平行四边形-FE的比,GB-BF的比等于平行四边形-BC和平行四边形-FE的比,因此,AB-FE的比等于BC-FE的比,因此,平行四边形-AB的比等于平行四边形-BC；DB 与 BE 之比等于 GB 与 BF 之比；DB 与 BE 之比等于 AB 与 FE 之比；GB 与 BF 之比等于 BC 与 FE 之比；AB 与 FE 之比等于 BC 与 FE 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03bdd7e73ae0870013ad5886619cd6b3c11d0ede2bd20c1f77ec8206a55e4e57","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行方形等一角又等即等角旁之两边为互相视之边两平行方形之一角等而等角旁两边为互相视之边即两形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个平行四边形的角相等；其中一个角也相等；也就是说，等角相邻的两边是互相对看的边；两个平行四边形的一个角相等，且等角相邻的两边是互相对看的边；也就是说，这两个图形相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b764abaef28e0ae5cd903468d9f397477df5226e58c1a37efee288035e5554d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙辛乙戊己庚两平行方形等甲乙丙戊乙庚两角又等题言此两角各两旁之两边为互相视之边者甲乙与乙庚之比例若戊乙与乙丙也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：甲乙丙辛乙戊己庚，两个平行四边形相等，且 甲乙丙戊乙庚 的两个角相等。命题：说明这两个角的两边是互相对看的边。甲乙 与 乙庚 的比如同 戊乙 与 乙丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bae3c80d648cf35d57befca1d96b8348e428f74395d856de1044e6ae60dab60","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试以两等角相聨于乙令甲乙乙庚为一直线其甲乙丙与戊乙庚既等角即戊乙乙丙亦一直线〈一卷十五增题〉次从辛丙己庚各引长之遇于丁其辛乙乙己两平行方形既等即辛乙与乙丁两形之比例若乙己与乙丁也〈五卷七〉而辛乙与乙丁俱在两平行线之内等高即辛乙与乙丁两形之比例若其底甲乙与乙庚也〈本篇〉〈一〉依显乙己与乙丁两形亦若其底戊乙与乙丙也则甲乙与乙庚亦若戊乙与乙丙也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：将两个相等的角连接到 乙，令 甲乙乙庚 为一直线。甲乙丙 和 戊乙庚 都是相等的角，即 戊乙乙丙 也是一条直线。〈一卷十五增题〉 从 辛丙己庚 延长，在 丁，两个平行四边形 辛乙乙己 相等，即 辛乙 和 乙丁。如果 乙己 和 乙丁 也是 〈五卷七〉，且 辛乙 和 乙丁 都在两条平行线上，则它们具有相同高度，即 辛乙 和 乙丁 高度相等。如果 甲乙 和 乙庚 在 〈本篇〉〈一〉 相等角下，则 乙己 和 乙丁 在底边 戊乙 和 乙丙 也相等，则 甲乙 和 乙庚 也等于 戊乙 和 乙丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9457caf25a1e17a0d19e9db374cee7abcb225b58962e8c1c298a1c86e0889220","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：甲乙丙戊乙庚等角两旁之各两边为互相视之边者甲乙与乙庚若戊乙与乙丙也题言辛乙乙己两平行方形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以下说明如下：甲乙丙戊乙庚 等角的两边是互相对看的边；甲乙 和 乙庚 如果 戊乙 和 乙丙 也是命题，则说明 辛乙乙己 两个平行四边形，相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7118812e7dbd3bb5128b24c8333bded9bd1b8952fa3297e85ea648eacd9bdbef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：依上论以两等角相聨其甲乙与乙庚之比例既若戊乙与乙丙而甲乙与乙庚两底之比例若平行等高之辛乙与乙丁两形〈本篇一〉戊乙与乙丙两底之比例若平行等高之乙己与乙丁两形则辛乙与乙丁若乙己与乙丁矣而辛乙乙己两形安得不等〈五卷九〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：根据上述论证，甲乙 与 乙庚 的比由两个相等的角连接。如果 戊乙 和 乙丙 以及 甲乙 和 乙庚 是两条底边，则 辛乙 和 乙丁 与相同高度 〈本篇一〉戊乙 相平行，乙丙 是两条底边，如果 乙己 和 乙丁 平行且高度相等，则 辛乙 和 乙丁 是 乙己 和 乙丁，且 辛乙乙己 不相等。〈五卷九〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-14.source","contentId":"euclid-6-14","revisionId":"euclid-6-14@raw-3a5bc8b2ab43dfaa","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c9aa9a575aefa3641be41a442c7483d75cbaf8dfc371e160412278de2fd1538","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-14:euclid-1-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-14.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 14"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-14:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-14.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"V. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-14:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-14.proof.3","euclid-6-14.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-14:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-14.proof.3","euclid-6-14.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-14:euclid-5-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-14.proof.6"],"targetC